<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Interleisure again renews cautionary.</title>
<headline>Interleisure again renews cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interleisure Ltd on Wednesday renewed an earlier cautionary announcement and urged shareholders to continue to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
